
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Our Little Memories ❤️</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="gallery.css">
</head>

<body>

<div class="gallery-container">

    <div class="top-label">✦ A COLLECTION OF BEAUTIFUL MOMENTS ✦</div>

    <h1>Our Little Memories</h1>

    <p class="subtitle">
        Every picture holds a memory,<br>
        and every memory reminds me of you. ❤️
    </p>

   
<div class="gallery">

    <div class="photo-card" onclick="openPhoto(this)">
        <img src="https://placehold.co/600x800/24102f/ffffff?text=Memory+1" alt="Memory 1">
        <p>One Beautiful Moment ❤️</p>
    </div>

    <div class="photo-card" onclick="openPhoto(this)">
        <img src="https://placehold.co/600x800/32153d/ffffff?text=Memory+2" alt="Memory 2">
        <p>A Moment to Remember ✨</p>
    </div>

    <div class="photo-card" onclick="openPhoto(this)">
        <img src="https://placehold.co/600x800/40204b/ffffff?text=Memory+3" alt="Memory 3">
        <p>My Favorite Smile 💗</p>
    </div>

    <div class="photo-card" onclick="openPhoto(this)">
        <img src="https://placehold.co/600x800/51265b/ffffff?text=Memory+4" alt="Memory 4">
        <p>Forever in My Heart 🌙</p>
    </div>

    <div class="photo-card" onclick="openPhoto(this)">
        <img src="https://placehold.co/600x800/382044/ffffff?text=Memory+5" alt="Memory 5">
        <p>Our Sweetest Memories 💕</p>
    </div>

    <div class="photo-card" onclick="openPhoto(this)">
        <img src="https://placehold.co/600x800/482654/ffffff?text=Memory+6" alt="Memory 6">
        <p>Always Special to Me ❤️</p>
    </div>

</div>

    <p class="bottom-text">
        SOME MOMENTS BECOME MEMORIES. SOME MEMORIES BECOME FOREVER.
    </p>

    <button onclick="goNext()">MAKE A WISH ✨</button>

</div>

<div class="lightbox" id="lightbox" onclick="closePhoto()">
    <span class="close">&times;</span>
    <img id="lightboxImage" src="" alt="Selected memory">
</div>

<script src="gallery.js"></script>

</body>
</html>
